# Signal Rock's relay store (CIPlay signal_rock_cave; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe (11-17 w15): an
# hw_mount knoll on the headland's east end (heart 57 20, b 10), a level adit dug in from the headland's flat at 57 8.5
# (yaw 0: way in = +z; w15G: one level 4 m wide passage from z 10 to the knoll's heart at 22); the sign srstoresign at 50 3; zone
# sr_store at 57 17. No monsters. Floor ~2.5 (dig log): in-cave pictures at absolute heights.
island Signal Rock keep
offset 19.9544 4.2646
hour 11
weather Calm

picture sr_store_out 57 +2 3 57 +1.5 9.5
read RELAY STORE
walk 57 1 to 57 6 to 57 8.5 to 57 12 to 57 17
zone sr_store
picture sr_store_in 57 5.2 13.5 57 4.2 21 light=20
walk 57 17 to 57 20
picture sr_store_end 57 5 16 57 4.6 22.5 light=20
walk 57 20 to 57 12 to 57 8.5 to 57 6 to 57 1
